tuxdoku (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Sound effects and two looping background music tracks (all CC0,
    synthesized), music/effects volume sliders and mute toggles,
    M / S keyboard shortcuts, settings screen, silent fallback when no
    audio device is available.
  * First Debian package.

